      "side": 1,
      "message": "I commented in the other CL but this config is more accurately describing whether the trap is enabled or disabled, so it might be better to have it named `CONFIG_ENABLE_UNALIGNED_ACCESS_TRAP` (which would mean inverting the logic) or `CONFIG_DISABLE_UNALIGNED_ACCESS_TRAP`",
