      "writtenOn": "2023-06-29T18:25:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does Zephyr use the `core/cortex/cpu.c` code that we change in https://crrev.com/c/4652005? I\u0027m guessing it does not, but @patrykd@google.com could probably confirm. If not, we\u0027ll need to have the equivalent to the change in [this file](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/4652005/13/core/cortex-m/cpu.c) for Zephyr or setting this config will be a no-op.\n\nIn that case, I think we could change this help text to indicate this is currently a noop, and then create a followup CL to enable it in Zephyr.",
